<title>INDIA: India gold prices rise, silver slides.</title>
<headline>India gold prices rise, silver slides.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold prices finished higher on Thursday at the local market after a lower start drew seasonal demand, dealers said.</p>
<p>Prices of gold biscuit (116.50 grammes) rose 50 rupees to 60,300 per piece.</p>
<p>Silver prices fell sharply on the back of fresh arrivals and selling by local stockists following reports of setback in the world market.  </p>
